	)
	(text "SN74LVC8T245: A = 3.3 V (GPIO), B = 5 V, DIR via R209 = A -> B, OE = ACT_OE_N (pull-up R501 on Controller).\nR201-R205 pull-ups (servo/ESC stage inverts), R206-R208 pull-downs (LED data); R216-R218 LED pull-downs (to Lighting_IO)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b657070-71d6-573a-acb5-ffca1f05e723")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 22.86 144.78)
		(end 407.67 248.92)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type dash)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "c4220331-268c-58f8-be1b-4756dc4c43ea")
	)
	(text "2  Open-drain outputs ESC J106, servos J102-J105"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c6982ca-a3db-53eb-8fc6-2376488eaebb")
	)
	(text "Q20x NTR4003N (30 V) with BAT54 + 2.2k pull-up from +5V: a foreign voltage on the signal pin reaches neither +5V nor U201 (VCU on or off).\nINVERTED stage - firmware inverts the LEDC outputs. R21x gate pull-ups keep the lines low while U201 is Hi-Z. J106 pin 2 (ESC BEC +) not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "03891abc-0a3b-513b-a4fa-f7bb21365c2f")
	)
	(text "Actuators: 3.3 V -> 5 V buffer and protected servo/ESC outputs (Pinplan 3.1, 4, 7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 48.26 0)
